# Installation

Learn how to install neobrutalism components.

## 1. Initialize shadcn

As explained in introduction, most of these components are based onShadcn UI. 

Visit the <a href="https://shadcn-svelte.com/docs/installation" target="_blank">shadcn-svelte docs</a> to see how to initialize shadcn.

## 2. Add styling

Open your `app.css` file and delete any existing styles.  
Then, visit the <a href="https://www.neobrutalism.dev/styling" target="_blank">Neobrutalism Styling Page</a> to choose your preferred design.  

> **Note:** The site refers to `global.css`, which is intended for the React version. For your setup, copy the styles directly into your `app.css`.

Once you've added the styles, return here to continue.

## 3. Install components

Each components page will have installation instructions.

